WEBVTT

00:23.982 --> 00:25.650
‎Biochip is secure.

00:25.734 --> 00:27.152
‎What about the punk?

00:27.235 --> 00:28.653
‎He's of no value now.

00:28.737 --> 00:30.071
‎Scrap him.

01:10.695 --> 01:11.738
‎Capri...

02:50.795 --> 02:53.006
‎Hey, Sal. Brought you a reel.

02:53.965 --> 02:55.216
‎Roman.

02:55.300 --> 02:58.219
‎This is probably the last one of D.

02:58.887 --> 03:01.431
‎You didn't go?

03:01.514 --> 03:03.391
‎-Go where?
‎-You haven't heard?

03:06.686 --> 03:10.273
‎The riots in Heywood have been dispersed.

03:10.982 --> 03:13.359
‎While the suspected
‎instigator remains at large,

03:13.443 --> 03:16.029
‎all other threats have been neutralized.

03:16.112 --> 03:19.741
‎Travel conditions in the district
‎are expected to return to normal shortly.

03:24.162 --> 03:25.622
‎Who's there?

03:27.916 --> 03:28.917
‎Talia.

03:30.209 --> 03:31.252
‎Where've you been?

03:33.546 --> 03:34.672
‎Weak?

03:36.466 --> 03:37.467
‎I'm sorry.

04:07.372 --> 04:08.373
‎Weak?

04:10.583 --> 04:11.876
‎Miss Yang?

04:11.960 --> 04:14.712
‎Found the Yangs' daughter.
‎She's in the morgue now.

04:16.422 --> 04:18.466
‎No, I haven't asked her yet.

04:38.444 --> 04:40.238
‎Wait, where's the body?

04:40.321 --> 04:42.490
‎-We've disposed of it.
‎-Disposed of it?

04:43.074 --> 04:45.243
‎Our orders were to get the chip...

04:45.910 --> 04:47.161
‎You killed him?

04:48.579 --> 04:51.499
‎Fucking morons! Idiots! Worthless trash!

04:52.083 --> 04:55.461
‎His body's worth more
‎than a thousand of you!

05:01.384 --> 05:02.844
‎-Die.
‎-Kyoko, enough!

05:03.386 --> 05:05.054
‎Who fucked up the orders?!

05:05.138 --> 05:06.723
‎This is on you!

05:08.141 --> 05:10.560
‎Only the chip? Where's the boy?

05:10.643 --> 05:12.312
‎Says they scrapped him!

05:12.812 --> 05:15.523
‎This is why Kang Tao
‎will always be second-rate.

05:15.606 --> 05:16.607
‎Militech would never have let--

05:18.985 --> 05:20.653
‎Will that suffice?

05:21.404 --> 05:22.947
‎Now check the chip if you please.

05:35.835 --> 05:37.503
‎Eat this!

05:37.587 --> 05:39.964
‎-Fuck!
‎-Can ya hear me?

05:40.048 --> 05:41.340
‎Let's go, chooms.

05:49.182 --> 05:50.224
‎Don't.

05:51.100 --> 05:52.226
‎Don't touch her.

05:52.310 --> 05:54.479
‎Please be reasonable.

05:54.562 --> 05:58.024
‎I said no. My dad's not even here yet.

05:58.107 --> 06:00.234
‎We've got his sign-off already.

06:00.318 --> 06:02.445
‎Then where the hell is he?!

06:03.154 --> 06:04.363
‎I'm sorry.

06:04.447 --> 06:06.074
‎The fuck does that mean?!

06:06.157 --> 06:08.826
‎Stop! You're not burning my mom!

06:08.910 --> 06:10.119
‎Dammit!

06:10.203 --> 06:12.371
‎You know I'd help right now if I could.

06:15.416 --> 06:16.459
‎Mom!

06:41.109 --> 06:43.903
‎How'd it get to this...

06:50.952 --> 06:52.829
‎Imagine you're sitting
‎on a pile o' eddies.

06:52.912 --> 06:56.624
‎No wait, a room full of eddies.
‎A swimming pool.

06:56.707 --> 06:59.585
‎-‎A football stadium!
‎-So, what's the plan now?

07:02.964 --> 07:06.300
‎Can't believe you caused
‎a riot against Arasaka.

07:06.384 --> 07:07.593
‎Are you stupid?

07:09.637 --> 07:13.599
‎It's only safe to crash here
‎one night, tops. Is that clear?

07:14.517 --> 07:17.979
‎I greased the receptionist,
‎but it won't hold.

07:31.701 --> 07:35.913
‎What did you want to accomplish?
‎Revenge this, revenge that...

07:36.581 --> 07:38.583
‎You keep this up, it's gonna kill you.

07:38.666 --> 07:40.084
‎That what you want?

07:50.887 --> 07:53.973
‎Sorry to bother.
‎I'm calling about Ms. Talia Yang...

07:55.683 --> 07:56.934
‎"Blank"?

07:57.018 --> 07:59.687
‎-What do you mean "blank?"
‎-Shut up.

07:59.770 --> 08:02.607
‎Her soul's gone missing!
‎It's not on the damn chip!

08:03.107 --> 08:05.693
‎Fuck! It's just a piece of junk!

08:06.319 --> 08:08.321
‎It must have some power still. Perhaps--

08:08.404 --> 08:09.697
‎Use your brain for a second!

08:09.780 --> 08:13.075
‎That's a brakeless car doing
‎a hundred on the highway.

08:13.159 --> 08:15.203
‎And we don't even have a body it fits!

08:15.286 --> 08:17.705
‎Damn it! How did he...

08:19.040 --> 08:23.920
‎Think... He looked like shit,
‎but he was still clearly himself.

08:24.462 --> 08:28.424
‎And he didn't seem to be talking
‎with any voices in his head.

08:29.133 --> 08:32.553
‎Installs don't take that long, anyway.

08:33.221 --> 08:34.514
‎Which means...

08:36.974 --> 08:38.726
‎Did she split somewhere?

08:44.815 --> 08:45.900
‎Kyoko?

08:45.983 --> 08:48.069
‎Yes, yes, Kyoko here.

08:48.152 --> 08:49.695
‎You OK? It looked bad...

08:50.947 --> 08:53.491
‎Ah! That was nothing...

08:53.574 --> 08:57.578
‎A little rattled of course.
‎How kind of you to worry about me.

08:57.662 --> 08:58.746
‎That's good...

08:59.497 --> 09:01.624
‎D was actin' strange, real strange.

09:01.707 --> 09:02.833
‎But uh...

09:02.917 --> 09:05.753
‎Y'know you kinda were too... seemed off.

09:05.836 --> 09:08.923
‎Rattled, as I said.

09:09.006 --> 09:11.008
‎Now, I'd like to talk to you about D.

09:12.260 --> 09:14.554
‎The boy may not seem himself,

09:14.637 --> 09:17.348
‎but... he doesn't seem
‎cyberpsychotic either.

09:17.431 --> 09:19.892
‎-In my expert opinion.
‎-Really?

09:20.518 --> 09:24.355
‎That shard in his neck...
‎It's no normal chip.

09:25.147 --> 09:28.150
‎It must be a prototype
‎or something of the kind.

09:28.818 --> 09:31.654
‎When he first inserted it...
‎his troubles started right then?

09:32.613 --> 09:33.781
‎Guess so.

09:33.864 --> 09:36.951
‎Whatever you know of the shard, tell me.

09:37.535 --> 09:39.370
‎You might be the key to helping him.

09:40.454 --> 09:44.750
‎This one time...he slotted
‎the shard into a girl. A choom of mine.

09:44.834 --> 09:48.337
‎He what?! He put the chip in someone else?

09:48.421 --> 09:52.008
‎Why would he do that?

09:52.091 --> 09:54.260
‎To remove it, give it away,
‎take it back? Why?

09:54.343 --> 09:55.803
‎What happened to her?

09:56.554 --> 09:58.014
‎Knocked her out,

09:58.097 --> 10:01.475
‎sent her to the hospital. She couldn't
‎really move or do anything after.

10:01.559 --> 10:03.436
‎She's OK now, I think...

10:03.519 --> 10:05.438
‎Seemed bad, but bounced back.

10:06.188 --> 10:07.398
‎She recovered?

10:09.317 --> 10:11.694
‎Hey, Kyoko? Do you know something?

10:11.777 --> 10:13.571
‎Again, you're saying she's healthy?

10:13.654 --> 10:17.658
‎Yeah, kinda. Stable, at least.
‎Still at the hospital.

10:17.742 --> 10:19.201
‎Which hospital?

10:19.285 --> 10:23.205
‎Kyoko, why the sudden interest?
‎What's she matter to you?

10:23.789 --> 10:26.626
‎Problem's D. He's off-grid.
‎Saw the feeds yourself.

10:26.709 --> 10:28.919
‎-‎What is this shard?
‎-Sorry. Call you back.

10:33.507 --> 10:37.303
‎No doubt about it. That must've been
‎the moment Capri's engram split!

10:38.179 --> 10:39.388
‎It can't be...

10:39.472 --> 10:40.806
‎What? What is it?

11:00.534 --> 11:01.535
‎Talia.

11:02.453 --> 11:04.664
‎How did Mom die?

11:05.956 --> 11:06.957
‎I'm sorry.

11:07.500 --> 11:09.752
‎That's what you're here
‎to tell me, isn't it?

11:10.503 --> 11:12.880
‎Don't tell me you came
‎all this way just to check on me.

11:14.256 --> 11:15.257
‎Yeah.

11:19.678 --> 11:23.015
‎Your mom and I broke into
‎a Kang Tao research facility.

11:23.891 --> 11:27.186
‎We got caught at the end.
‎During the escape, Avida was shot.

11:28.354 --> 11:30.940
‎By the time we reached
‎the hospital... She was already...

11:31.899 --> 11:33.401
‎Why would she do that?

11:34.110 --> 11:36.862
‎We were gonna find you another body.

11:37.863 --> 11:39.990
‎...A body? For me?

11:40.658 --> 11:44.412
‎The thought being, if we could
‎transfer your soul into a new one...

11:44.495 --> 11:46.247
‎you'd get a second chance.

11:47.415 --> 11:48.874
‎My soul?

11:48.958 --> 11:50.668
‎Tech called Soulkiller.

11:51.460 --> 11:55.089
‎Arasaka developed it,
‎and Kang Tao's got their own copy.

11:56.132 --> 12:00.052
‎The facility we broke into was
‎where they kept the bodies meant for it.

12:01.387 --> 12:02.972
‎You were really gonna do that?

12:03.597 --> 12:05.099
‎You and Mom?

12:05.933 --> 12:08.352
‎We wanted to save you.

12:09.520 --> 12:11.814
‎Who asked you to?

12:13.357 --> 12:15.818
‎What made you think I would want that?

12:18.028 --> 12:20.698
‎It weighed on your mom until the very end.

12:22.741 --> 12:24.243
‎This is bullshit.

12:24.910 --> 12:26.787
‎This is bullshit!

12:43.596 --> 12:46.265
‎Talia. You seem to be doing well.

12:46.932 --> 12:49.310
‎Dad. You're a little late.

12:50.019 --> 12:51.645
‎They already put Mom in a jar.

12:52.730 --> 12:55.274
‎She died trying to save me!

12:55.357 --> 12:56.775
‎You bastard--

12:58.027 --> 12:59.487
‎Talia! He was there!

12:59.570 --> 13:02.364
‎At the facility, commanding the unit!

13:03.699 --> 13:07.119
‎He knew Avida was there
‎and opened fire anyway!

13:07.786 --> 13:09.079
‎Please put a muzzle on him.

13:13.626 --> 13:15.503
‎Dammit, let me go!

13:19.924 --> 13:21.133
‎Come with me.

13:21.842 --> 13:23.761
‎Did you shoot Mom?

13:23.844 --> 13:25.304
‎That's ridiculous.

13:25.387 --> 13:28.849
‎I was there! You killed Avida!

13:28.933 --> 13:30.559
‎Why can I still hear him?

13:32.603 --> 13:34.772
‎-Go.
‎-Answer him!

13:34.855 --> 13:37.608
‎Don't touch me! Lemme go!

13:37.691 --> 13:40.653
‎Capri! Do something!

13:41.195 --> 13:42.780
‎Don't...

13:43.656 --> 13:46.033
‎Don't you lay a hand on my daughter.

13:46.116 --> 13:48.619
‎Sorry? What're you raving about?

13:48.702 --> 13:50.079
‎Think I misheard.

13:50.162 --> 13:53.707
‎Avida told me. Talia's my daughter.

13:55.960 --> 13:57.253
‎There it is.

13:57.336 --> 13:59.463
‎Is that what Avida said?

13:59.547 --> 14:02.132
‎It all makes sense now.

14:10.683 --> 14:13.060
‎You miserable fool. Look here.

14:14.645 --> 14:18.732
‎Proof. Talia is mine
‎by every imaginable measure.

14:27.533 --> 14:31.287
‎Genes! Bloodline! Bone structure!

14:31.871 --> 14:34.665
‎Everything says she's mine!

14:35.624 --> 14:38.544
‎Talia is ‎my‎ daughter!

14:51.015 --> 14:53.100
‎You could've checked yourself.

14:53.183 --> 14:56.312
‎Just one simple test would
‎have proved it beyond any doubt.

14:58.689 --> 15:00.691
‎But you were eager to buy her story.

15:01.901 --> 15:04.695
‎Because deep down you feared the truth.

15:05.404 --> 15:07.197
‎She's my daughter.

15:17.291 --> 15:21.795
‎Talia is my daughter!

15:27.217 --> 15:31.138
‎Dad? Did you kill Mom?

15:32.264 --> 15:33.849
‎A pointless question.

16:06.215 --> 16:07.216
‎Avida...

16:08.676 --> 16:13.889
‎That means if you purchase it
‎with standard armor-plating,

16:13.973 --> 16:17.351
‎this British sports-limo is safer than
‎a tank, and, as I'm sure you'd agree,

16:17.434 --> 16:18.602
‎offers far more panache.

16:19.770 --> 16:22.231
‎This is a side of you I don't recognize.

16:25.818 --> 16:29.905
‎Remember? You saved me, once.

16:30.531 --> 16:31.532
‎Back when we...

16:34.868 --> 16:38.622
‎They're all gone.

16:38.706 --> 16:39.790
‎What?

16:40.541 --> 16:42.376
‎The people that hit our clan...

16:43.043 --> 16:44.795
‎The suit that ordered it...

16:45.421 --> 16:46.880
‎They're all dead.

16:48.757 --> 16:51.135
‎And not a single thing
‎I did fuckin' mattered.

16:52.011 --> 16:53.012
‎Oh...

16:54.805 --> 16:56.348
‎What was I supposed to do?

17:05.733 --> 17:09.111
‎Hmm... I see...

17:09.194 --> 17:10.654
‎Hmm...

17:14.158 --> 17:17.494
‎Hey, are these electromagnets
‎in her arms and legs?

17:17.578 --> 17:18.620
‎Will it work or not?

17:18.704 --> 17:22.166
‎These for motion-assist?
‎Were you training her for the circus?

17:23.751 --> 17:26.879
‎Whoa, relax. Just asking...

17:28.797 --> 17:30.924
‎Girl's really sick, isn't she?

17:31.550 --> 17:35.054
‎We slowed the illness by replacing
‎her failing tissue with cyberware.

17:35.971 --> 17:38.348
‎Believing she possessed
‎a special tolerance to it...

17:38.932 --> 17:40.309
‎She does.

17:40.392 --> 17:43.228
‎Saw her on an Arasaka list.

17:43.896 --> 17:45.731
‎Flagged as a host candidate for Capricorn.

17:46.523 --> 17:47.566
‎Did they now?

17:47.649 --> 17:52.488
‎Of course, she was too risky to go after,
‎being the kid of a rival corp exec.

17:53.238 --> 17:55.240
‎But... will this still work?

17:55.324 --> 17:56.325
‎In what sense?

17:56.992 --> 17:59.995
‎Her tolerance
‎has already reached its limit,

18:00.621 --> 18:02.456
‎pushing her to the brink
‎of cyberpsychosis.

18:03.123 --> 18:05.250
‎On top of that,
‎the illness has spread to her brain.

18:05.334 --> 18:07.836
‎The doctors say
‎she doesn't have long to live.

18:08.712 --> 18:11.507
‎Say the install succeeds, but Talia dies...

18:12.132 --> 18:14.093
‎what happens to Capricorn?

18:15.594 --> 18:16.595
‎What?

18:17.221 --> 18:19.848
‎Which one are you worried about?

18:21.433 --> 18:22.810
‎It's fine.

18:22.893 --> 18:24.978
‎There's some brain damage, sure.

18:25.062 --> 18:30.734
‎But Capricorn's already begun repairing
‎some of it during the installation.

18:31.693 --> 18:34.696
‎Full installation should
‎allow for further recovery.

18:34.780 --> 18:37.950
‎But the process will overwrite
‎the host's native consciousness,

18:38.033 --> 18:39.827
‎and she'll disappear.

18:40.994 --> 18:41.995
‎I see.

18:42.579 --> 18:43.872
‎So I have your go-ahead?

18:44.915 --> 18:48.919
‎You can begin. As I said,
‎she has little time left anyway.

18:49.002 --> 18:52.172
‎Good. Spoken like a true corpo.

19:04.643 --> 19:05.769
‎Hey.

19:07.062 --> 19:08.272
‎Capri.

19:08.981 --> 19:12.025
‎Sorry, but you gotta go bye-bye now.

19:12.609 --> 19:15.404
‎Well, I guess technically...
‎you'll become me.

19:16.363 --> 19:17.656
‎I see.

19:17.739 --> 19:21.451
‎That's it?
‎You really are a strange cookie.

19:23.245 --> 19:24.580
‎Don't you have any regrets?

19:25.956 --> 19:27.791
‎It's not like I don't, but...

19:35.841 --> 19:37.759
‎...Mm. Actually...

19:38.510 --> 19:40.429
‎Will you kill him for me?

19:41.221 --> 19:42.806
‎As gruesome as you can.

19:43.974 --> 19:45.559
‎For my mom.

19:47.603 --> 19:48.687
‎Okay.

19:55.277 --> 19:56.737
‎Oh, hey Kyoko...

20:09.041 --> 20:10.125
‎Mmm. That's better.

20:10.792 --> 20:13.212
‎Is it safe to remove her restraints?

20:13.295 --> 20:15.005
‎-I didn't do that.
‎-What?

20:15.881 --> 20:17.883
‎Thanks, Kyoko.

20:21.470 --> 20:24.181
‎I can finally do whatever I want.

20:24.264 --> 20:26.934
‎You shouldn't be up. Sit back down.

20:32.814 --> 20:33.815
‎Restrain her!

20:43.700 --> 20:47.246
‎I was asked to make this
‎as gruesome as possible.

20:47.329 --> 20:50.249
‎But that doesn't mean
‎it can't be fun, too, right?

20:50.332 --> 20:52.542
‎I'll give you a 3-minute head start.
‎Better start running.

20:52.626 --> 20:53.919
‎Daddy.

20:56.421 --> 20:57.547
‎That's enough!

21:06.139 --> 21:09.059
‎You really thought this would stop me?

21:11.937 --> 21:13.063
‎There, gave ya a handicap!

21:13.146 --> 21:15.065
‎Fuck! What's wrong with you?!

21:15.148 --> 21:19.486
‎Aw nuts, think I gave ya
‎the wrong kind of handicap!

21:19.569 --> 21:20.570
‎Sorry, sorry!

21:20.654 --> 21:21.738
‎What're you--

21:25.534 --> 21:27.452
‎Commencing countdown!

21:28.453 --> 21:32.332
‎Ten... Nine... Eight...

21:34.418 --> 21:35.585
‎Capri!

21:37.754 --> 21:39.089
‎You're alive.

21:39.756 --> 21:42.259
‎Is it... done?

21:43.218 --> 21:44.428
‎Is the installation complete?

21:46.179 --> 21:50.475
‎Why's everyone so obsessed
‎with revenge, anyway?

21:51.810 --> 21:55.230
‎Is revenge, like, fun?

21:55.314 --> 21:56.732
‎What are you...

21:57.858 --> 21:59.693
‎Wait! Capri!

22:23.592 --> 22:25.886
‎The subject has escaped.

22:25.969 --> 22:28.597
‎Deploy a team to find
‎and secure her immediately!

22:29.139 --> 22:31.641
‎Escaped? What are you talking about?

22:31.725 --> 22:33.643
‎You'll get a full report later!

22:33.727 --> 22:35.520
‎Just get a damn team moving!

22:36.354 --> 22:38.648
‎Move them where? And... wait.

22:40.358 --> 22:41.818
‎What is it?

22:41.902 --> 22:43.487
‎I can see you.

22:59.002 --> 23:00.003
‎What is this?

23:01.129 --> 23:03.632
‎Just hurry!

23:03.715 --> 23:05.550
‎Shit!

23:07.135 --> 23:10.639
‎C'mon, put a little pep in your step!

23:11.139 --> 23:12.182
‎Shit!

23:12.265 --> 23:14.935
‎There you go! Keep it moving!

23:22.400 --> 23:23.401
‎Talia?

23:26.655 --> 23:31.451
‎Hey. You asked yesterday
‎what you were supposed to do.

23:33.286 --> 23:35.622
‎It doesn't matter.

23:35.705 --> 23:38.125
‎You could'a done anything.

23:39.126 --> 23:42.838
‎The past, the present... it doesn't matter.
‎You should'a done what you wanted, David.

23:57.018 --> 23:58.019
‎Capri.

24:06.319 --> 24:07.445
‎Who's this?

24:07.529 --> 24:09.781
‎Directive received to capture Capricorn.

24:10.490 --> 24:14.077
‎Team arriving shortly. Maintain heading.
‎Proceed straight down the street.

24:14.161 --> 24:15.162
‎Understood.

24:25.130 --> 24:27.632
‎Done already?

24:51.740 --> 24:54.034
‎Hey! Where do you think you're going?!

24:55.243 --> 24:56.870
‎Gonna go find Capri.

24:56.953 --> 24:58.997
‎Capri? Who or what is that?

25:02.500 --> 25:03.752
‎This is the last time, Omi.

25:05.837 --> 25:08.173
‎This is the end of the line.

25:10.926 --> 25:12.260
‎Lend me a hand.

25:12.928 --> 25:14.512
‎I can't do this on my own.

25:22.103 --> 25:23.939
‎You're not making any sense.

25:24.022 --> 25:25.982
‎Ow! What was that for?!

25:26.566 --> 25:31.446
‎I don't understand any of it.
‎But... fine. I'll help.

25:31.529 --> 25:33.615
‎Just let me change first.

